{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 9, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "合關東, 從通之於秦, 故曰連橫者也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 35, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "利, 饒也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 46, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "用, 用武也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 57, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "皆有塞險要也, 故曰之限也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 66, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "肴, 在澠池西. 函關, 舊在弘農城北門外, 今在新安東. 固, 牢堅, 難攻易守也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 104, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "沃野千里, 故田美民富.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 110, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "攻之不可得, 守之不可壞, 故曰形便也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 117, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "府, 聚也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 150, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "敎, 習也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 162, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 10, "text": "呑, 滅也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 183, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 11, "text": "奏, 事. 效, 驗也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 185, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 124, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_002_ko_002_0010_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "蘇秦", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "關東", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦 惠王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "巴", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "蜀", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "漢中", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "代", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "巫山", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "黔中", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "肴", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "函", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "肴", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "澠池", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "函關", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "弘農城", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "新安", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "關中", "type": "지명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_002_0010_0010", "locator": "戰國策 › 『戰國策』 卷第三 秦 一 › 蘇秦始將連橫, 合關東, 從通之於秦, 故曰連橫者也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_002_0010_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_002", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 蘇秦始將連橫, 說秦 惠王曰：｢大王之國, 西有巴·蜀·漢中之利, 北有胡貉·代馬之用, 南有巫山·黔中之限, 東有肴·函之固, 田肥美, 民殷富, 戰車萬乘, 奮擊百萬, 沃野千里, 蓄積饒多, 關中, 地勢形便, 此所謂天府, 天下之雄國也. 以大王之賢, 士民之衆, 車騎之用, 兵法之敎, 可以幷諸侯, 呑天下, 稱帝而治, 願大王少留意, 臣請奏其效.｣.", "title": "蘇秦始將連橫, 合關東, 從通之於秦, 故曰連橫者也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 80, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "一本無漆身字.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 103, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 63, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_002_ko_002_0020_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "范雎", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "范雎", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "范雎", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "接輿", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "殷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楚", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "接輿", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_002_0020_0010", "locator": "戰國策 › 『戰國策』 卷第五 秦 三 › 范雎至秦, 王庭迎, 謂范雎曰", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_002_0020_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_002", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 范雎至秦, 王庭迎, 謂范雎曰：…… 范雎謝曰：｢……臣何憂乎? 箕子·接輿, 漆身以爲厲, 被髮而爲狂, 無益於殷·楚. 使臣得同行於箕子·接輿, 漆身, 可以補所賢之主, 是臣之大榮也. …….｣.", "title": "范雎至秦, 王庭迎, 謂范雎曰", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 5, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "一本無上二字,", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 141, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 95, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_002_ko_002_0030_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "蘇秦", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "齊 閔王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "桓", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "樓煩", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_002_0030_0010", "locator": "戰國策 › 『戰國策』 卷第十二 齊 五 › 蘇秦, 一本無上二字, 說齊 閔王曰", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_002_0030_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_002", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 蘇秦, 說齊 閔王曰：｢……昔者, 齊·燕戰於桓之曲, 燕不勝, 十萬之衆盡, 胡人襲燕 樓煩數縣, 取其牛馬. 夫胡之與齊, 非素親也, 而用兵又非約質而謀燕也. 然而甚於相趨者, 何也? 何則形同憂而兵趨利也. 由此觀之, 約於同形則利長, 後起則諸侯可趨役也. …….｣.", "title": "蘇秦, 一本無上二字, 說齊 閔王曰", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 163, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『續』云, 史備燕·三胡·秦·韓之邊.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 201, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "集, 劉錢作簡主實晉陽, 而襄主兼戎取代.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 376, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "一作聞.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 413, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 288, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_002_ko_002_0040_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "靈王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "王孫緤", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "公子成", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "河", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "薄洛", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "中山", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "常山", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "代", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "上黨", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "東胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "樓煩", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "韓", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "河", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "薄洛", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "參胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "續", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "史", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "韓", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "樓煩", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "韓", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "簡主", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "晉陽", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "上黨", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "襄王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "戎", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "代", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "集", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "劉錢", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "簡主", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "晉陽", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "襄主", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "戎", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "代", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "中山", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "鄗", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "鄗", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "上黨", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "中山", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "簡", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "襄", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "公子成", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "簡", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "襄", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_002_0040_0010", "locator": "戰國策 › 『戰國策』 卷第十九 趙 二 › 武靈王平晝間居, ……王遂胡服, 使王孫緤告公子成曰", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_002_0040_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_002", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 武靈王平晝間居, ……王遂胡服, 使王孫緤告公子成曰：｢…….｣. 王曰：｢吾固聞叔之病也. ……. 今吾國東有河·薄洛之水, 與齊 中山同之, 而無舟檝之用. 自常山以至代·上黨, 東有燕·東胡之境, 西有樓煩·秦·韓之邊, 而無騎射之備. 故寡人且取舟檝之用, 求水居之民, 以守河·薄洛之水. 變服騎射, 以備其參胡·樓煩·秦·韓之邊. 且昔者, 簡主不塞晉陽, 以及上黨, 而襄王兼戎取代, 以攘諸胡. 此愚知之所明也. 先時, 中山負齊之强兵, 侵掠吾地, 係累吾民, 引水圍鄗, 非社稷之神靈, 卽鄗幾不守, 先王忿之, 其怨未能報也. 今騎射之服, 近可以備上黨之形, 遠可以報中山之怨, 而叔也順中國之俗, 以逆簡·襄之意, 惡變服之名, 而忘國事之恥, 非寡人所望於子.｣. 公子成再拜稽首曰：｢臣愚不達於王之議, 敢道世俗之間, 今欲繼簡·襄之意, 以順先王之志, 臣敢不聽今.｣. 再拜, 乃賜胡服.", "title": "武靈王平晝間居, ……王遂胡服, 使王孫緤告公子成曰", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 63, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 44, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_002_ko_002_0050_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "黃帝", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "涿", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "西戎", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "禹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "三苗", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "東夷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "黃帝", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_002_0050_0010", "locator": "戰國策 › 『戰國策』 卷第二十三 魏 二 › 五國伐秦, 無功而還.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_002_0050_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_002", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 五國伐秦, 無功而還. ……黃帝戰於涿鹿之野, 而西戎之兵不至. 禹攻三苗, 而東夷之民不起. 以燕伐秦, 黃帝之所難也.", "title": "五國伐秦, 無功而還.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 289, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 204, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_002_ko_002_0060_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "蘇秦", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕 文侯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "遼東", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "林胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "樓煩", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "雲中", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "九原", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "呼沱", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "易水", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "碣石", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "鴈門", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "趙", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "趙", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "趙", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "趙", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "雲中", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "九原", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "代", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "上谷", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_002_0060_0010", "locator": "戰國策 › 『戰國策』 卷第二十九 燕一 › 蘇秦將爲從, 北說燕 文侯曰", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_002_0060_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_002", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 蘇秦將爲從, 北說燕 文侯曰：｢燕東有朝鮮·遼東, 北有林胡·樓煩, 西有雲中·九原, 南有呼沱·易水, 地方二千餘里, 帶甲數十萬, 車七百乘, 騎六千疋, 粟支十年. 南有碣石·鴈門之饒, 北有棗粟之利. 民雖不由田作, 棗栗之實, 足食於民矣. 此所謂天府也. 夫安樂無事, 不見覆軍殺將之憂, 無過燕矣. 大王知其所以然乎? 夫燕之所以不犯寇被兵者, 以趙之爲蔽於南也. 秦·趙五戰, 秦再勝而趙三勝, 秦·趙相弊, 而王以全燕制其後, 此燕之所以不犯難也. 且夫秦之攻燕也, 踰雲中·九原, 過代·上谷, 彌埊踵道數千里, 雖得燕城, 秦計固不能守也. …….｣.", "title": "蘇秦將爲從, 北說燕 文侯曰", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 132, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 89, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_002_ko_002_0060_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "宋", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "宋", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "蘇代", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕 昭王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "宋", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "淮", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "北夷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "魯", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "衛", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_002_0060_0020", "locator": "戰國策 › 『戰國策』 卷第二十九 燕一 › 齊伐宋, 宋急, 蘇代乃遺燕 昭王書曰", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_002_0060_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_002", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 齊伐宋, 宋急, 蘇代乃遺燕 昭王書曰：｢……足下以宋加淮北, 强萬乘之國也. 而齊幷之, 是益一齊也. 北夷方七百里, 加之以魯·衛, 此所謂强萬乘之國也, 以齊幷之, 是益二齊也. 夫一齊之强, 而燕猶不能支也, 今乃以三齊臨燕, 其禍必大矣. …….｣.", "title": "齊伐宋, 宋急, 蘇代乃遺燕 昭王書曰", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 119, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "一作批, 曾錢作棑.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 443, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "曾錢作秦王懸金.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 620, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 428, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_002_ko_002_0070_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "燕太", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "丹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "易水", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "丹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "鞫武", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "武", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "韓", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "魏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "趙氏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "易水", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "曾錢", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "樊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "鞫武", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "樊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "管", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "晏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "樊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "匈奴", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "晉", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楚", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "丹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "樊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "丹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "丹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "匈奴", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "丹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "荊卿", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "樊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "曾錢", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "樊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "督亢", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "秦王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "趙", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "王剪", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕王 喜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "丹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "遼東", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "李信", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "燕王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "代王 嘉", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "丹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕國", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "燕王 喜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_002_0070_0010", "locator": "戰國策 › 『戰國策』 卷第三十一 燕 三 › 燕太子丹質於秦, 亡歸, 見秦且滅六國,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_002_0070_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_002", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 燕太子丹質於秦, 亡歸, 見秦且滅六國, 兵以臨易水, 恐其禍至. 太子丹患之, 謂其太傅鞫武曰：｢燕·秦不兩立, 願太傅幸而圖之.｣. 武對曰：｢秦地遍天下, 威脅韓·魏·趙氏, 則易水以北, 未有所定也. 奈何以見陵之怨, 欲排, 其逆鱗哉?｣. 太子曰：｢然則何由?｣. 太傅曰：｢請入, 圖之.｣. 居之有間, 樊將軍亡秦之燕, 太子容之. 太傅鞫武諫曰：｢不可. 夫秦王之暴, 而積怨於燕, 足爲寒心. 又况聞樊將軍之在乎! 是以委肉當餓虎之蹊, 禍必不振矣. 雖有管·晏, 不能爲謀. 願太子急遣樊將軍入匈奴以滅口. 請西約三晉, 南連齊·楚, 北講於單于, 然後乃可圖也.｣. 太子丹曰：｢太傅之計, 曠日彌久, 心惛然, 恐不能須臾, 且非獨於此也. 夫樊將軍困窮於天下, 歸身於丹, 丹終不迫於强秦, 而棄所哀憐之交, 置之匈奴, 是丹命固卒之時也. 願太傅更慮之.｣.\n荊卿曰：｢微太子言, 臣願得謁之. 今行而無信, 則秦未可親也. 夫今樊將軍, 秦王購之金, 千斤, 邑萬家, 誠能得樊將軍首, 與燕 督亢之地圖獻秦王. 秦王必說見臣, 臣乃得有以報太子. ……. 於是, 秦大怒燕, 益發兵, 詣趙, 詔王剪軍以伐燕, 十月而拔燕 葪城. 燕王 喜·太子丹等皆率其精兵, 東保於遼東. 秦將李信追擊燕王, 王急, 用代王 嘉計, 殺太子丹欲獻之秦. 秦復進兵攻之, 五歲而卒滅燕國, 而虜燕王 喜, 秦兼天下.", "title": "燕太子丹質於秦, 亡歸, 見秦且滅六國,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
